          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but the seventh day is a sabbath unto Jehovah thy God: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " thou shalt not do any work, thou, nor thy son, nor thy daughter, thy man-servant, nor thy maid-servant, nor thy cattle, nor thy stranger that is within thy gates: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for in six days Jehovah made heaven and earth, the sea, and all that in them is, and rested the seventh day: wherefore Jehovah blessed the sabbath day, and hallowed it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
